# Selecting three tasks and choosing Group in Go to Command wraps them in a new parent that is typed in right away.
file <<END
Trip:
	- Passport
	- Tickets
	- Charger
Home:
	- Water plants
END
keys j <S-Down> <S-Down>
keys :
type group
keys <Enter>
type Documents
keys <Esc>
see ▌   Documents
quit
saved <<END
Trip:
	Documents
		- Passport
		- Tickets
		- Charger
Home:
	- Water plants
END
